WEBVTT


00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:34.040
Mr. Lee says hello.


00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:35.260
How king.


00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:37.360
And goodbye too.


00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:42.930
Who are these people?
- Mr. Lee's henchmen!


00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:43.900
At last.


00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.620
We're doomed!


00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:47.720
No, they are.


00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:16.720
Countess...?


00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:20.300
Thank you. You saved my life.


00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.940
My pleasure.


00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:24.040
It almost got bad.


00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:26.605
How can I ever thank you?


00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:36.460
Your skills are many, Hubert.


00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:38.560
I do my duty, Countess.


00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:42.140
But from now on, beware of Mr. Lee.


00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:44.535
And of Chinamen in general.


00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:48.140
They covet your lmperial family treasures.


00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.580
Dirty reds!


00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.680
Dirty yellows!


00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:53.840
No, dirty reds.


00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:56.880
My mistake.


00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:01.860
You don't know China well,
Mr. Bonisseur de la Bath.


00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:03.340
Well,


00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:06.415
you'll have to show me parts of it.


00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.290
As private as they may be.


00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:30.335
Department of External Archives
and Counter-lntel...


00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:38.475
Morning, Fayolle!
- Morning, de la Bath!


00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.180
Morning, Lutran.


00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.740
Hi, Corbier.
- Hi, Hubert.


00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.620
Morning, de la Bath.


00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.060
Poulard...


00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:48.710
Morning!
- Morning, de la Bath!


00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.380
Good skiing?
- Excellent, Ledentu.


00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:53.580
Can I see the boss?
- Okie-dokie.


00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.180
That's a good one.


00:04:55.280 --> 00:04:57.280
I like that.


00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.080
Okie-dokie...


00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.740
Morning, Jean-Pierre.
Great disguise!


00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:04.880
Thank you.
- My pleasure!


00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.500
Mayeux, Castaing...


00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:09.600
Morning, de la Bath.


00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:11.420
No news from Picot?


00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:14.070
Not a word. Not since Roussel.


00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:17.130
And Lefranc?
- He spoke to Mongier.


00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:19.020
What does Borges say?


00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:22.265
What can he say?
He agrees with Favre.


00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:25.600
And with Duvernois.


00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.700
I'm off, de la Bath.


00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.500
Say hello to Granville.


00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.600
Will do.


00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:33.780
In fact, Comolet says hi.


00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:35.060
Dear old Bernarg.


00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.100
I saw him last with Charpon,
Labbouze and Delanois.


00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:39.940
Francarg too. Time flies!


00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:42.040
I'll say!


00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:50.340
What are you looking at?
- A blue-print.


00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:53.755
For building a duck-shaped paddle boat.


00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:55.760
What's it for?


00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:58.305
Same as a normal paddle boat.


00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.620
Keep an eye on it...


00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:02.720
Of course.


00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:06.520
I have to see Forguier.


00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.220
Knock-knock!


00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:12.420
The chief is waiting for you.


00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:14.520
Thanks, Ledentu.


00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:24.780
Morning, Armand.


00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:28.060
Good to see you, Hubert.
How was Gstaad?


00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:32.700
Well, okie-dokie. Chilly at dawn,
sunny at noon. Great slopes.


00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:34.420
Glad to hear it.


00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:35.860
A new mission.


00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:37.660
Music to my ears!


00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:39.760
This is for you.


00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:43.140
He is Professor Von Zimmel,
a Nazi dignitary.


00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:44.180
Or rather...


00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:46.280
he was.


00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:55.720
American technology.


00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:01.420
His name is now Octavio Pela Luerdo,


00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.980
a South American wrestling impresario.


00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:04.860
Clever.


00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:07.300
He has decided to blackmail France.


00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.660
So we stop him?
- No, we pay him.


00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:10.700
I'll be gamned!


00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:14.780
He has a microfilm list
of French collaborators with Nazis.


00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:18.500
No surprise its..microfilm.
The list must be tiny.


00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:21.575
Well, it's not that simple, Hubert.


00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:25.340
Didn't General de Gaulle say
all France resisted?


00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:27.440
He gig indeed.


00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:31.120
Yes, he did.


00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:35.360
Yep...


00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:42.380
In any case, you, ll go to Rio
and buy the list for 50,000.


00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.100
Francs?
- Yes.


00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:46.200
Clever.


00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:50.235
Why me?
The Postal Service could do it.


00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:54.500
I know, Hubert.
But Von Zimmel wants our best agent.


00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:58.340
Of course. In that case,
the usual procedure?


00:07:58.720 --> 00:07:59.860
Your papers.


00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:02.700
You're a reporter for an evening paper.


00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.940
Your name is Noel Flantier.


00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.040
Noel Flantier?


00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.660
Who picks these names?


00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:12.990
Archibald Fletanchard from Undercover.


00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:16.040
Noel Flantier...


00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.080
I'll send a memo.


00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.860
Look on the bright side.


00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:21.820
Rio de Janeiro is beautiful.


00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:23.580
The girls are gorgeous.


00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:24.740
You, ll relax.


00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:26.700
What?
- You can relax.


00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:28.800
Not a word I know.


00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:27.560
Taxi, sir?


00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:28.860
Why not?


00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.425
Where to?
- Copacobana Palace.


00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:45.620
Welcome to Rio, sir.


00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:47.720
Obrigado!


00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:51.800
Obrigado...


00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.000
This is not the way.


00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:07.920
It's an ambush!


00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.960
Get out! And don't move!


00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:21.485
You kill brother in Gsta.


00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:23.060
Now die.


00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:25.965
Last stop Rio for O-tet-tet 1 17.


00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:28.180
Pargon me?


00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:31.085
You kill brother in Gsta.
Now die.


00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:33.620
I'm sorry...


00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:35.995
Gsta. Swizzleland. Ski.


00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:38.800
Gstaad!


00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:40.860
Gsta...


00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:42.380
Find my accent funny?


00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:43.540
Not at all.


00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:45.780
You racist!
- I swear I'm not!


00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:47.420
I lived in Cochinchina!


00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:50.920
Farewell O-tet-tet 1 17, racist.
Now die.


00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:58.660
Get in, Hubert.


00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.060
Bill Trumendous!


00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:02.160
Dear old Bill!


00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:08.385
Right in the back!
- See that?


00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:13.800
So, good old Hubert?


00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:16.005
Trouble with the Chinese?


00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:19.650
Not at all.
He mistook me for someone else.


00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:23.065
From their perspective,
we look alike.


00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:30.740
And you, dear Bill?


00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:33.900
South America interests the CIA now?


00:11:44.440 --> 00:11:46.020
Good old Hubert!


00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:48.330
Same old barrel of laughs.


00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:21.835
It's so fucking hot!


00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:25.320
Kidding aside...


00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:28.340
Why are you following me?
- You tell me.


00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:31.300
Why are you here, bastard?
What's going on?


00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:33.780
I'm on vacation. That's all.


00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:37.660
I know you, Hubert.


00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:39.980
Your presence means trouble.


00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:42.820
I'm here for the women and the beaches.


00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:46.140
I've heard great things.
I came to check out Brazilian women.


00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.240
Whatever!


00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:11.320
Thanks, old chap.


00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:15.820
If your memory comes back, call me.


00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:19.235
I will, if the Tourism Bureau is closed.


00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:22.580
Okay, let's do that then.


00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:24.680
Take care, pal.


00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:20.620
I'm terribly clumsy.


00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:22.180
It would seem that l...


00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:24.280
splattered you.


00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:29.000
Be my guest.


00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:31.590
A woman who splatters a man...


00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:34.490
is like morning dew in springtime.


00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:38.020
Ahead lie beautiful days and fiery nights.


00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:39.420
What a wake-up!


00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:40.700
I'm for nothing.


00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:44.965
The hardy arrogance of your beauty
has sprayed me.


00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:54.480
You're gorgeous, Mr...


00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:59.285
Flantier. Noel Flantier.
Reporter.


00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:01.140
My pleasure. Carlotta.


00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:02.620
Reporting on what?


00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:03.740
Brazil.


00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:06.580
Vast subject.
You need an angle of attack.


00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:08.805
I'm currently searching.


00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:13.105
Magnificent. Do you exercise?


00:16:13.560 --> 00:16:15.560
Not even.


00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:16.780
Superb.


00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:18.880
I have a good pedigree.


00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:22.950
Let me slip into something more comfy.


00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:34.415
I'll also be slipping into something comfy.


00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:00.080
Carlotta?


00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:12.505
Who'd want to harm Carlotta?


00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.380
Mr. Bonisseur de la Bath


00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:23.480
No, Flantier.


00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:32.540
or the microfilm, bring the money
to the look-out point.


00:17:32.640 --> 00:17:34.640
You'll recognize us.


00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:51.880
Get in!


00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:17.140
Keep calm, double-one seven.


00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:19.240
Delightful voyage.


00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:36.380
Sorry to appear rude.
We needed a calm spot, double-one 7.


00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:37.900
One-seventeen.


00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:41.230
But the name is Flantier.
Mr. Flantier.


00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:43.620
I'm Colonel Staman.


00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:44.980
This is Colonel Kutner.


00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:46.380
My pleasure. Noel Flantier.


00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:49.200
I'm doing an article on Brazil.


00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:50.460
Don't bother.


00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.860
We know why you're here,
double-one 7.


00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:54.700
One-seventeen.


00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:56.380
We want the same man.


00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:57.340
Go on.


00:20:57.440 --> 00:20:59.060
Professor Von Zimmel.


00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:00.700
Go on.
- Enough.


00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:02.420
Will you work with the Mossad?


00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:04.520
Go on.


00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:07.360
It's your turn.


00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:10.580
Will you work with the Mossad?


00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:12.220
The...?
- Mossad.


00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:14.320
Israeli Secret Service.


00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:20.116
Hunt down a Nazi with Jews?
How strange!


00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:22.700
Why?


00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:24.180
He'll recognize them.


00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:25.620
How so?


00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:27.845
Their noses, obviously...


00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:30.560
Their ears, fingers,


00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:32.640
their eyes.


00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:40.005
I didn't mean anything...


00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:42.500
You're France's best agent?


00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:43.900
I mean...


00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:47.549
'The best'...
It, s not for me to say.


00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:50.390
And as I often say...


00:21:54.840 --> 00:21:57.730
Mr. 717, this is Dolores Kuleshov.


00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:00.195
You'll team up with her.


00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:30.280
Thrilled to meet you.


00:22:30.440 --> 00:22:32.440
It's an honor, OSS 117.


00:22:33.440 --> 00:22:36.700
Your fight against Nazi barbarism
is world-renown.


00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:40.180
Our teachers wax poetic
about your exploits.


00:22:40.280 --> 00:22:43.000
For many of us, you're a legend.


00:22:43.120 --> 00:22:45.140
A true remedy against savagery.


00:22:45.240 --> 00:22:48.180
I must tell you you're a symbol of liberty.


00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:49.860
I am moved and honoreg...


00:22:49.960 --> 00:22:52.170
to work with you, OSS 117.


00:22:54.640 --> 00:22:56.680
Such a pretty secretary!


00:22:56.720 --> 00:22:57.660
Excuse me?


00:22:57.760 --> 00:23:00.905
I'm happy to have a pretty secretary.


00:23:01.800 --> 00:23:03.840
I'm not your secretary.


00:23:04.600 --> 00:23:06.600
Whose, then?


00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:08.540
No one's.


00:23:08.640 --> 00:23:10.980
I, m a colonel in the lsraeli army.


00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:14.225
We'll be working together, as eQuals.


00:23:14.920 --> 00:23:18.830
Tell me when you have
to carry something heavy.


00:23:24.520 --> 00:23:27.193
You can spend the night here.


00:23:27.440 --> 00:23:30.075
Your assailants won't find you.


00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:33.460
The microfilm is of no interest to us.


00:23:33.560 --> 00:23:34.900
We want Von Zimmel.


00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:36.260
I understand.


00:23:36.360 --> 00:23:38.910
Remember Eichmann?
- Of course.


00:23:38.960 --> 00:23:42.020
We'll capture Von Zimmel the same way.


00:23:42.120 --> 00:23:45.095
Judge him in lsrael for his crimes.


00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:46.620
Which are...?


00:23:46.720 --> 00:23:48.720
Which are...


00:23:49.000 --> 00:23:50.340
Abetting genocide.


00:23:50.440 --> 00:23:52.440
Oh that! Yeah...


00:23:53.480 --> 00:23:55.480
That was some story.


00:24:07.040 --> 00:24:08.820
We'll search together.


00:24:08.920 --> 00:24:11.500
You get the microfilm,
we get the man.


00:24:11.600 --> 00:24:13.380
It'll be just you two.


00:24:13.480 --> 00:24:14.460
Excellent.


00:24:14.560 --> 00:24:16.500
We're leaving for Tel Aviv.


00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:19.700
Officially,
we've never even heard of you.


00:24:19.800 --> 00:24:20.780
Clever.


00:24:20.880 --> 00:24:22.860
Leave the money here.
- I can't.


00:24:22.960 --> 00:24:27.635
It belongs to France.
I can't leave it with just anyone.


00:24:28.960 --> 00:24:31.740
Don't take..'just anyone' personally.


00:24:31.840 --> 00:24:36.100
Don't think I believe what they say
about... Jews and money.


00:24:36.200 --> 00:24:38.200
It's not the case.


00:24:39.480 --> 00:24:41.948
Want to see your room?
- Yes!


00:24:51.200 --> 00:24:52.780
Pajamas, toothbrush.


00:24:52.880 --> 00:24:56.025
Thanks, I'll only use the toothbrush.


00:24:56.120 --> 00:24:58.500
Do as you please. Goodnight.


00:25:03.600 --> 00:25:05.140
Thanks for the toothbrush.


00:25:05.240 --> 00:25:07.240
You're welcome.


00:25:09.960 --> 00:25:12.000
Goodnight.
- Night, guys.


00:25:21.920 --> 00:25:23.920
Nice night, isn't it?


00:25:26.760 --> 00:25:29.820
I'm sorry for before.
I was terribly clumsy.


00:25:29.920 --> 00:25:32.580
Don't worry.
I'll atone for my sins.


00:25:32.680 --> 00:25:34.680
Consider it forgotten.


00:25:34.960 --> 00:25:36.960
I realize that I was...


00:25:37.080 --> 00:25:39.080
Anti-Semitic?


00:25:40.400 --> 00:25:42.100
I was thinking 'clumsy'.


00:25:42.200 --> 00:25:43.740
Same difference.


00:25:43.840 --> 00:25:44.860
Don't worry.


00:25:44.960 --> 00:25:46.900
You weren't speaking viciously.


00:25:47.000 --> 00:25:51.340
We're used to it. Our people
have always provoked wild fantasies.


00:25:51.440 --> 00:25:53.480
Thanks for admitting it.


00:25:53.560 --> 00:25:57.130
You're obviously a little bit responsible.


00:25:58.760 --> 00:26:00.780
Don't get angry. We need him.


00:26:00.880 --> 00:26:03.005
I'll do what I can, sir.


00:26:05.960 --> 00:26:07.960
Goodnight to you too.


00:26:12.680 --> 00:26:15.380
Let, s begin at the Copacabana Palace.


00:26:15.480 --> 00:26:18.420
I'll get some stuff and leave my briefcase.


00:26:18.520 --> 00:26:21.100
Fine. I'll start working on my own.


00:26:21.200 --> 00:26:22.340
That's too bad.


00:26:22.440 --> 00:26:24.735
Why not come see the hotel?


00:26:24.800 --> 00:26:27.220
Thanks but I'd rather get working.


00:26:27.320 --> 00:26:29.700
Don't be silly. There's a pool.


00:26:29.800 --> 00:26:33.020
We, ll start this afternoon with a bang.


00:26:33.120 --> 00:26:34.900
Thank you, l, d rather not.


00:26:35.000 --> 00:26:36.540
Let's meet at 1 p.m.


00:26:36.640 --> 00:26:38.640
As you wish.


00:26:38.640 --> 00:26:40.640
See you shortly.


00:26:58.040 --> 00:27:00.165
You kill brother in Gsta.


00:27:00.520 --> 00:27:01.420
Excuse me?


00:27:01.520 --> 00:27:04.080
Say bye-bye to Rio, OSS 117.


00:27:05.120 --> 00:27:07.120
Herr Flantier?


00:27:08.920 --> 00:27:11.045
Follow us, Herr Flantier.


00:27:34.120 --> 00:27:36.120
Great to see you again.


00:27:36.280 --> 00:27:38.915
We haven't spoken since Gstaad.


00:27:39.480 --> 00:27:41.020
I wanted to thank you.


00:27:41.120 --> 00:27:42.660
Excellent mission.


00:27:42.760 --> 00:27:44.760
Very pleasant.


00:27:46.880 --> 00:27:50.660
Don't be upset
I couldn't kill all those Chinks.


00:27:50.760 --> 00:27:52.760
I'm sorry.


00:27:53.040 --> 00:27:55.930
I know you hate those rice-eaters.


00:27:59.760 --> 00:28:02.650
Very stubborn, those litchi-faces.


00:28:04.400 --> 00:28:06.400
Those grapefruit heads.


00:28:08.280 --> 00:28:10.748
Sturdy, those prune skins.


00:28:13.760 --> 00:28:15.760
Pineapple hearts.


00:28:17.320 --> 00:28:19.320
Lemon wedges.


00:28:21.880 --> 00:28:23.880
Bananas flambe.


00:28:24.000 --> 00:28:26.000
Before they get lit.


00:28:26.200 --> 00:28:28.200
Just bananas!


00:28:30.760 --> 00:28:32.760
I get off here.


00:28:40.880 --> 00:28:42.880
The Germans.


00:28:42.880 --> 00:28:44.880
Yes, the Germans!


00:28:55.800 --> 00:28:58.220
Would it be possible, if it exists,


00:28:58.320 --> 00:29:02.740
to consult a list of former Nazis
residing in Brazil?


00:29:05.800 --> 00:29:07.420
There must be a...


00:29:07.520 --> 00:29:11.593
society of former Nazis?
A club, an association?


00:29:14.360 --> 00:29:15.820
A Nazi Guild?


00:29:15.920 --> 00:29:17.920
Germany is a democracy.


00:29:18.040 --> 00:29:22.460
In no way does the Embassy
know the whereabouts of Nazis.


00:29:22.560 --> 00:29:24.380
Among fellow Germans...


00:29:24.480 --> 00:29:26.690
All Germans are not Nazis.


00:29:28.120 --> 00:29:29.660
I've heard that theory.


00:29:29.760 --> 00:29:31.955
I must ask you to leave.


00:29:32.520 --> 00:29:34.520
Very well.


00:29:34.520 --> 00:29:36.520
Empty-hangeg, alas.


00:29:40.360 --> 00:29:42.740
France is the country of 400 cheeses.


00:29:42.840 --> 00:29:45.220
What's cheese in Brazilian?


00:29:47.440 --> 00:29:49.650
Are you okay? Is all well?


00:29:50.600 --> 00:29:52.895
So? Have you made progress?


00:29:55.680 --> 00:29:57.540
Be my guest. You first.


00:29:57.640 --> 00:30:01.975
I may be a secret agent,
but I'm French nonetheless.


00:30:02.640 --> 00:30:05.100
I think I've done some good work.


00:30:05.200 --> 00:30:08.700
The ClA has been in contact
with Von Zimmel.


00:30:08.800 --> 00:30:12.030
Their agent in Rio is Bill Trumendous.


00:30:14.800 --> 00:30:17.030
Bravo! I'm very impressed.


00:30:17.240 --> 00:30:19.300
We've reached similar ends.


00:30:19.400 --> 00:30:22.035
With a slight advantage for me.


00:30:22.720 --> 00:30:24.720
Mr. Trumendous' card.


00:30:42.360 --> 00:30:44.360
Good old Hubert!


00:30:46.400 --> 00:30:50.225
You always have the cutest dolls
by your side.


00:30:50.320 --> 00:30:51.260
Dear olg Bill!


00:30:51.360 --> 00:30:55.015
You take every little bird under your wing!


00:30:57.160 --> 00:30:59.160
Too darn hot!
- Sure is!


00:31:00.920 --> 00:31:03.180
Wendy, bring us 3 Groovy coconuts.


00:31:03.280 --> 00:31:06.510
Shorten those skirts.
They make me hot.


00:31:07.640 --> 00:31:09.980
Brazil is a mysterious country.


00:31:10.080 --> 00:31:12.460
People appear and disappear.


00:31:12.880 --> 00:31:16.450
After 20 years here,
there must be a trace.


00:31:22.960 --> 00:31:24.260
Maybe so...


00:31:24.360 --> 00:31:26.360
but I gon't know.


00:31:26.720 --> 00:31:28.060
Maybe what?


00:31:28.160 --> 00:31:30.880
His son Heinrich is here in Rio.


00:31:31.320 --> 00:31:34.260
I seem to remember he lives in a favela.


00:31:34.360 --> 00:31:37.080
He was involved in hippie sects.


00:31:37.200 --> 00:31:39.200
What?
- Hippie sects.


00:31:39.800 --> 00:31:41.500
Good God.


00:31:41.600 --> 00:31:43.600
Sex with horses...


00:31:44.560 --> 00:31:46.060
What next?


00:31:46.160 --> 00:31:48.160
Hippie sects.


00:31:49.040 --> 00:31:51.040
Because hippic sex...


00:31:51.120 --> 00:31:52.140
Hold on.


00:31:52.240 --> 00:31:54.240
I may have a picture.


00:31:55.200 --> 00:31:57.580
This is Heinrich Von Zimmel.


00:31:59.560 --> 00:32:01.560
That hair!


00:32:02.400 --> 00:32:04.400
Why look like a girl?


00:32:04.720 --> 00:32:06.460
Unusual.


00:32:06.560 --> 00:32:08.560
What do they want?


00:32:10.120 --> 00:32:12.120
It's a form of protest.


00:32:12.320 --> 00:32:14.320
To change the world.


00:32:16.880 --> 00:32:18.880
Change the world?


00:32:19.120 --> 00:32:20.460
What a strange idea.


00:32:20.560 --> 00:32:23.280
The world's fine. Why change it?


00:32:24.320 --> 00:32:26.740
They want to make love, not war.


00:32:26.840 --> 00:32:28.340
But both are possible.


00:32:28.440 --> 00:32:32.180
I've always done both.
So far, no complaints!


00:32:35.200 --> 00:32:37.200
Good old Hubert!


00:32:37.720 --> 00:32:39.720
You too!


00:32:41.200 --> 00:32:42.940
Come on...


00:32:43.040 --> 00:32:44.660
No sense of humor!


00:32:44.760 --> 00:32:49.265
Everyone talks about Jewish humor.
It's not too funny!


00:32:49.720 --> 00:32:51.720
No, it's not too funny.


00:32:54.520 --> 00:32:56.520
Really?


00:32:57.040 --> 00:32:59.165
How can it be humor then?


00:32:59.400 --> 00:33:00.620
You pull it off.


00:33:00.720 --> 00:33:02.720
In your own way.


00:33:04.240 --> 00:33:06.240
Indeed.


00:33:11.880 --> 00:33:13.880
This city is stunning.


00:33:16.800 --> 00:33:18.800
And I know cities.


00:33:19.440 --> 00:33:22.980
How do they manage
to keep their shoes clean?


00:33:23.080 --> 00:33:25.080
They don't have shoes.


00:33:26.600 --> 00:33:28.260
Good one! No shoes!


00:33:28.360 --> 00:33:30.180
Not bad!


00:33:30.280 --> 00:33:32.700
Life here isn't easy for everyone.


00:33:32.800 --> 00:33:34.540
As in most dictatorships.


00:33:34.640 --> 00:33:36.660
Dictatorships! Listen to you!


00:33:36.760 --> 00:33:40.160
You're sweet,
but spare me your politics.


00:33:41.080 --> 00:33:43.420
You know what a dictatorship is?


00:33:43.520 --> 00:33:45.020
eople are communists.


00:33:45.120 --> 00:33:49.370
The Pre cold, with gray hats
and boots with zippers.


00:33:49.400 --> 00:33:50.940
That's a dictatorship.


00:33:51.040 --> 00:33:54.620
What do you call a country
with a military leader,


00:33:54.720 --> 00:33:57.940
secret police, one TV station
and censorship?


00:33:58.040 --> 00:33:59.900
I call that France, Miss.


00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:03.060
Not any France:. De Gaulle's France.


00:34:10.240 --> 00:34:12.240
I think it's here.


00:34:13.920 --> 00:34:16.385
Where is Heinrich Von Zimmel?


00:34:17.760 --> 00:34:19.900
I'll ask again.
Where is Von Zimmel?


00:34:20.000 --> 00:34:22.465
And put that transistor down.


00:34:23.000 --> 00:34:24.380
Stupid kid!


00:34:24.480 --> 00:34:26.480
Allow me.


00:34:47.600 --> 00:34:49.140
The hippies left.


00:34:49.240 --> 00:34:50.900
They're on a beach nearby.


00:34:51.000 --> 00:34:53.000
Okay, lets go.


00:34:53.800 --> 00:34:55.800
Goodbye.


00:34:57.200 --> 00:34:59.200
So long, kids.


00:35:03.520 --> 00:35:05.780
I saw you talking to that girl.


00:35:05.880 --> 00:35:07.300
Know what I thought?


00:35:07.400 --> 00:35:09.620
You're made to have children.


00:35:09.720 --> 00:35:13.340
This dangerous job is not for you.
You need a home.


00:35:13.440 --> 00:35:16.415
Kids that you can shower with love.


00:35:16.720 --> 00:35:19.950
It's a compliment I rarely give but...


00:35:19.960 --> 00:35:22.180
you're a natural-born mother.


00:35:22.280 --> 00:35:24.280
Can I ask something?


00:35:24.640 --> 00:35:25.540
Of course.


00:35:25.640 --> 00:35:28.020
Would you say this to a man?


00:35:28.320 --> 00:35:30.615
You know, men are rarely...


00:35:33.240 --> 00:35:35.240
mothers.


00:35:41.800 --> 00:35:43.800
Heinrich Von Zimmel.


00:35:43.840 --> 00:35:45.700
Here's my plan.
Simple and efficient.


00:35:45.800 --> 00:35:47.800
See that rock?


00:35:47.840 --> 00:35:49.180
Bring the kid there.


00:35:49.280 --> 00:35:52.425
Use your feminine wiles if necessary.


00:35:52.840 --> 00:35:55.135
Don't worry, it'll be fine.


00:36:05.240 --> 00:36:08.340
We're reporters. We want your father.
Where is he?


00:36:08.440 --> 00:36:10.940
This wasn't my plan.
- No, it's mine.


00:36:11.040 --> 00:36:13.460
Tell me or I'll blow your brains out.


00:36:13.560 --> 00:36:14.980
I have no idea!


00:36:15.080 --> 00:36:17.885
Not good enough!
- For me neither!


00:36:19.720 --> 00:36:21.930
I want to help, I promise!


00:36:22.200 --> 00:36:27.215
I can find his former partner.
We, ll go to him in Brasilia.


00:36:29.240 --> 00:36:31.435
I'll help you arrest him.


00:36:33.840 --> 00:36:35.940
I hate my father. He's a Nazi.


00:36:36.040 --> 00:36:38.040
He's a bastard.


00:36:39.200 --> 00:36:41.200
I'm ashamed.


00:36:44.080 --> 00:36:46.660
Don't badmouth your father!
Shame on you!


00:36:46.760 --> 00:36:47.860
Who brought you up?


00:36:47.960 --> 00:36:50.425
I never badmouthed my father!


00:36:50.960 --> 00:36:54.140
He was a wheelwright.
And we toed the line.


00:36:54.240 --> 00:36:57.555
Mother never complaineg.
Neither dig we!


00:36:57.560 --> 00:36:58.940
His father was a Nazi.


00:36:59.040 --> 00:37:02.525
Maybe.
But it was his father all the same.


00:37:04.000 --> 00:37:06.340
Tell me...
Your father was a wheelwright?


00:37:06.440 --> 00:37:08.260
No, a diplomat.


00:37:08.360 --> 00:37:10.825
I used psychological torture.


00:37:12.440 --> 00:37:14.340
But he'd already talked.


00:37:14.440 --> 00:37:15.540
Yes...


00:37:15.640 --> 00:37:18.180
but it's that systematic denigration.


00:37:18.280 --> 00:37:20.860
The parents, the family, then it's...


00:37:20.960 --> 00:37:22.960
the flag, the nation.


00:37:23.760 --> 00:37:25.420
But his father was SS!


00:37:25.520 --> 00:37:26.980
A Nazi.


00:37:27.080 --> 00:37:30.565
Not the same thing.
Not all Nazis were SS.


00:37:30.600 --> 00:37:32.600
Don't generalize.


00:37:32.800 --> 00:37:34.380
You can eat here.


00:37:34.480 --> 00:37:35.740
Yes!
- No thanks.


00:37:35.840 --> 00:37:36.780
We have to go.


00:37:36.880 --> 00:37:38.880
As you wish.


00:37:43.480 --> 00:37:45.020
Why not split up?


00:37:45.120 --> 00:37:47.670
So you can keep an eye on him.


00:37:49.360 --> 00:37:51.360
Is that better?
- Maybe.


00:37:52.800 --> 00:37:54.700
Are you trying to ditch me?


00:37:54.800 --> 00:37:56.800
Not at all.


00:37:58.760 --> 00:38:01.752
I'm kidding, Dolores.
Why would you?


00:38:19.440 --> 00:38:21.480
Do you do quiche?
- What?


00:38:22.240 --> 00:38:24.240
Quiche Lorraine.


00:38:31.440 --> 00:38:32.180
What is it?


00:38:32.280 --> 00:38:34.350
LSD.
- Excellent.


00:38:34.640 --> 00:38:38.720
I closed the shutter.
With 200 ASA, this light...


00:38:39.440 --> 00:38:41.440
is fine.


00:38:44.520 --> 00:38:45.580
change the world!


00:38:45.680 --> 00:38:49.060
You, re nice but...
everyone has to wake up.


00:38:49.160 --> 00:38:52.420
The world won't wait.
The world is moving.


00:38:52.520 --> 00:38:55.956
Moving fast.
You'll be left high and dry.


00:38:56.560 --> 00:38:59.340
What happens after summer vacation?


00:38:59.440 --> 00:39:00.860
We're not on vacation.


00:39:00.960 --> 00:39:02.260
Okay, fair enough.


00:39:02.360 --> 00:39:04.360
You're on sabbatical.


00:39:04.480 --> 00:39:06.480
What about next year?


00:39:06.480 --> 00:39:08.340
Thought about that?


00:39:08.440 --> 00:39:10.420
The world won, t bend to you.


00:39:10.520 --> 00:39:13.155
This isn't 1968, Year of Youth!


00:39:13.520 --> 00:39:15.300
That's not how it works.


00:39:15.400 --> 00:39:20.020
It's the real world out there.
The real world gets hair cuts.


00:39:20.120 --> 00:39:23.100
Guitars and troubadours
are dead and gone.


00:39:23.200 --> 00:39:25.200
I have my own.


00:39:31.520 --> 00:39:32.820
What was I saying?


00:39:32.920 --> 00:39:34.460
Dead troubadours.


00:39:34.560 --> 00:39:36.560
That's right.


00:39:36.760 --> 00:39:38.300
What about them?


00:39:38.400 --> 00:39:39.820
I can't remember.


00:39:39.920 --> 00:39:42.380
Don't say that. You disappoint me.


00:39:42.480 --> 00:39:45.115
I had to be saying something...


00:41:55.320 --> 00:41:56.860
I like what's happening.


00:41:56.960 --> 00:42:01.040
But understand...
it's our secret ang ours alone.


00:42:02.400 --> 00:42:05.437
No one has to know any of this.


00:42:05.640 --> 00:42:08.870
Out of context,
a finger up the butt...


00:42:11.080 --> 00:42:12.940
Let's clear this up.


00:42:13.040 --> 00:42:14.980
People can get the wrong idea.


00:42:15.080 --> 00:42:17.630
They start imagining things...


00:42:33.440 --> 00:42:35.440
Strange.


00:42:37.240 --> 00:42:39.240
Unusual route.


00:42:40.040 --> 00:42:42.165
How did it go last night?


00:42:42.240 --> 00:42:45.060
Excellent.
I spent a very relaxing evening.


00:42:45.160 --> 00:42:48.380
We ate. I took some RSVP
and slept like a baby.


00:42:48.480 --> 00:42:50.060
Lovely.


00:42:50.160 --> 00:42:52.880
Those hippies are actually nice.


00:42:53.080 --> 00:42:55.340
Once you get past their hygiene.


00:42:55.440 --> 00:42:57.440
What can I say?


00:42:57.800 --> 00:42:59.140
It's youth...


00:42:59.240 --> 00:43:02.980
Sooner or later,
reality will cut their hair.


00:43:06.360 --> 00:43:08.700
Dolores, I've been meaning...


00:43:08.800 --> 00:43:10.800
Freeze!


00:43:12.000 --> 00:43:14.125
You kill brother at Gsta.


00:43:14.480 --> 00:43:16.480
Now die.


00:43:17.720 --> 00:43:19.020
What does he want?


00:43:19.120 --> 00:43:21.120
How should I know?


00:43:22.560 --> 00:43:25.790
This plane is now your coffin,
OSS 117!


00:43:33.880 --> 00:43:35.540
Lockeg.


00:43:35.640 --> 00:43:36.580
And with a key.


00:43:36.680 --> 00:43:38.750
Compliments of Mr. Lee!


00:43:43.920 --> 00:43:46.810
Got a broach or a knitting needle?


00:43:48.160 --> 00:43:50.160
How about a key?


00:43:53.120 --> 00:43:54.860
A safety pin?


00:43:54.960 --> 00:43:57.170
Bra buckle?
- I'm bra-less.


00:43:59.320 --> 00:44:01.320
I have a hairpin!


00:44:05.240 --> 00:44:07.240
Hurry, Hubert!


00:44:18.280 --> 00:44:19.780
Why don't you have one?


00:44:19.880 --> 00:44:21.420
One what?
- A bra.


00:44:21.520 --> 00:44:22.580
Because.
- Why?


00:44:22.680 --> 00:44:26.080
It's my body and this isn, t the moment!


00:44:27.680 --> 00:44:29.680
Why look like a man?


00:44:29.720 --> 00:44:31.540
Unusual.


00:44:31.640 --> 00:44:33.640
Open!


00:44:35.920 --> 00:44:36.740
How's it going?


00:44:36.840 --> 00:44:38.700
Fine. We're losing altitude,


00:44:38.800 --> 00:44:42.060
aiming for the trees,
and no landing gear.


00:44:42.160 --> 00:44:43.820
So what's fine?


00:44:43.920 --> 00:44:45.180
Well, I'm here.


00:44:45.280 --> 00:44:46.100
My God!


00:44:46.200 --> 00:44:48.200
Thank you.


00:44:51.520 --> 00:44:53.520
Almost there?


00:45:05.920 --> 00:45:09.235
Hurry, it's on fire!
It's going to blow!


00:45:27.840 --> 00:45:29.060
Thanks, Noel.


00:45:29.160 --> 00:45:30.980
No problem.
- Good work.


00:45:31.080 --> 00:45:33.220
I'm intrigued by that Chinaman.


00:45:33.320 --> 00:45:35.540
He can't work for Von Zimmel.


00:45:35.640 --> 00:45:37.640
He might...


00:45:38.280 --> 00:45:41.340
Which Chinese worked with the Nazis?


00:45:41.600 --> 00:45:43.260
The Japanese?


00:45:43.360 --> 00:45:46.165
The Japanese, exactly.
My mistake.


00:45:46.520 --> 00:45:48.100
I had a vague theory.


00:45:48.200 --> 00:45:51.515
Chinamen from China don't fit into it.


00:46:11.320 --> 00:46:13.380
I wanted to thank you again.


00:46:13.480 --> 00:46:15.945
I'm proud to team up wth you.


00:46:16.160 --> 00:46:18.160
I understand.


00:46:18.200 --> 00:46:20.665
By the way, I meant to say...


00:46:21.120 --> 00:46:24.180
I know how much
you admire me, my career,


00:46:24.280 --> 00:46:28.300
my life, my profession,
my crusade against barbarism.


00:46:28.400 --> 00:46:30.400
Alas, it has a price.


00:46:30.400 --> 00:46:33.205
Dolores, I'll be brutally honest.


00:46:33.320 --> 00:46:36.550
If ever anything happens between us...


00:46:38.800 --> 00:46:40.916
I can't commit to women.


00:46:42.640 --> 00:46:46.140
My love affairs aren't long-term.
They're...


00:46:46.240 --> 00:46:48.535
short, compact, passionate.


00:46:49.560 --> 00:46:51.560
It's my modus operandi.


00:46:52.600 --> 00:46:54.980
Some people have adventures.


00:46:55.320 --> 00:46:57.320
I am an adventure.


00:46:57.320 --> 00:46:59.320
I just had to tell you.


00:47:00.240 --> 00:47:02.020
It's very kind of you.


00:47:02.120 --> 00:47:04.120
Thanks, Hubert.


00:47:04.360 --> 00:47:06.360
You're welcome.


00:47:07.000 --> 00:47:09.000
You're very kind.


00:47:10.720 --> 00:47:12.540
What's wrong?


00:47:12.640 --> 00:47:14.300
Nothing.


00:47:14.400 --> 00:47:16.420
You don't like men.
- Yes, why?


00:47:16.520 --> 00:47:18.020
You rebuffed me as if...


00:47:18.120 --> 00:47:20.120
Drop it, Hubert.


00:47:21.120 --> 00:47:22.940
Because I'm not Jewish?


00:47:23.040 --> 00:47:26.100
Why do you say that?
- Your religion is so...


00:47:26.200 --> 00:47:27.340
So what?


00:47:27.440 --> 00:47:30.020
It's a religion that forbids sausages.


00:47:30.120 --> 00:47:32.120
And?


00:47:32.200 --> 00:47:33.780
And nothing.


00:47:33.880 --> 00:47:35.860
Let's pretend that's normal.


00:47:35.960 --> 00:47:38.620
No sausages, no alcohol,
veiled women.


00:47:38.720 --> 00:47:40.020
Sorry it's sort of...


00:47:40.120 --> 00:47:42.120
Sort of?


00:47:42.920 --> 00:47:45.740
Sort of..'Simon says, no sausages!'
lsn't it?


00:47:45.840 --> 00:47:47.580
No, it isn't.


00:47:47.680 --> 00:47:51.420
You're confusing Jews and Muslims.
- Don't nitpick, Dolores.


00:47:51.520 --> 00:47:54.300
Between us,
that's what annoys people.


00:47:54.400 --> 00:47:57.180
The attitude 'I'm a Jew, I know everything.'


00:47:57.280 --> 00:48:00.580
Sorry if I upset you but I won't apologize.


00:48:00.680 --> 00:48:03.540
Your theories on Jews,
blacks and women...


00:48:03.640 --> 00:48:06.275
would be best kept to yourself.


00:48:09.280 --> 00:48:11.745
You're the one who, s upset.


00:48:28.200 --> 00:48:30.495
Can we cross it?
- Negative.


00:48:30.720 --> 00:48:32.580
It's a crocodile river.


00:48:32.680 --> 00:48:34.300
Too far to swim.


00:48:34.400 --> 00:48:36.100
We have to cross it.


00:48:36.200 --> 00:48:38.700
Yes, but for the moment we're stuck.


00:48:38.800 --> 00:48:40.800
We can't cross it yet.


00:48:40.880 --> 00:48:44.340
Since we cantt avoid the crocodiles,
we'll set up camp.


00:48:44.440 --> 00:48:46.260
Any objections?


00:48:46.360 --> 00:48:48.360
None.


00:48:48.960 --> 00:48:50.960
It's pretty here.


00:48:51.320 --> 00:48:53.320
We'll spend the night.


00:48:54.040 --> 00:48:55.820
This is what we'll go.


00:48:55.920 --> 00:48:57.340
I'll hunt.


00:48:57.440 --> 00:49:00.620
Heinrich,
I'd appreciate if you cut wood.


00:49:00.720 --> 00:49:02.900
Dolores, be nice.
Set us up a table.


00:49:03.000 --> 00:49:05.000
Something cute.


00:49:07.360 --> 00:49:08.220
What now?


00:49:08.320 --> 00:49:10.615
I,'m taking a dip. To wash.


00:49:16.200 --> 00:49:19.260
He'll get tons of germs, that's all.


00:49:24.240 --> 00:49:27.640
See, Noel?
Maybe this is what it means...


00:49:28.360 --> 00:49:30.360
change the world!


00:49:33.480 --> 00:49:35.480
Watch out!


00:49:39.720 --> 00:49:41.540
Thanks, I'll never forget it.


00:49:41.640 --> 00:49:42.500
My pleasure!


00:49:42.600 --> 00:49:45.405
Now we're friends forever.
- Deal!


00:49:45.560 --> 00:49:49.900
Next time you change the world,
watch out for crocodiles.


00:49:50.000 --> 00:49:52.380
Ask whatever you want of me.


00:49:57.680 --> 00:49:59.975
Start by wearing underwear.


00:50:09.200 --> 00:50:11.020
Who's laughing now?


00:50:11.120 --> 00:50:13.585
Here, Dolores.
Make us ginner.


00:50:13.720 --> 00:50:16.610
What should I do? It weighs a ton.


00:50:16.800 --> 00:50:19.500
I don't know. Just something simple.


00:50:19.600 --> 00:50:20.820
No one's judging.


00:50:20.920 --> 00:50:22.920
Judging what?


00:50:23.080 --> 00:50:27.820
I won't cook or set a table.
You judge women by their food?


00:50:27.920 --> 00:50:29.920
Listen, little lady.


00:50:30.480 --> 00:50:32.180
I did my job.


00:50:32.280 --> 00:50:33.940
I saved your lives.


00:50:34.040 --> 00:50:35.900
I just killed a crocodile.


00:50:36.000 --> 00:50:38.340
Want to be equals? Start working.


00:50:38.440 --> 00:50:40.340
You can at least make dinner.


00:50:40.440 --> 00:50:42.580
Shes right. We 'd eat that.


00:50:42.680 --> 00:50:44.020
Shes right?


00:50:44.120 --> 00:50:46.120
No need for drama.


00:50:47.040 --> 00:50:49.380
Your world sure is changing fast.


00:50:49.480 --> 00:50:51.480
I'll get dinner.


00:50:51.520 --> 00:50:53.900
I saw some berries up there.


00:50:54.920 --> 00:50:56.920
I'll join you!


00:50:57.440 --> 00:50:59.440
It figures.


00:51:13.400 --> 00:51:16.180
You don't want any fruit?
It, s very good.


00:51:16.280 --> 00:51:18.919
No thanks. I need my vitamins.


00:51:19.120 --> 00:51:21.120
That's silly.


00:51:21.400 --> 00:51:22.900
Of course.


00:51:23.000 --> 00:51:25.000
I'm the silly one.


00:51:32.160 --> 00:51:34.200
This thing doesn't cook.


00:51:35.280 --> 00:51:37.280
Why doesn't it cook?


00:51:50.440 --> 00:51:52.440
Is it cooking?
- Slowly.


00:51:52.880 --> 00:51:56.300
Crocodile skin is slow to roast.
No big deal.


00:51:56.400 --> 00:51:57.820
What do you want?


00:51:57.920 --> 00:51:59.920
I want to make peace.


00:52:00.120 --> 00:52:02.120
We're very tired.


00:52:02.480 --> 00:52:04.500
We should stick together.


00:52:04.600 --> 00:52:06.600
Why not ask Heinrich?


00:52:07.000 --> 00:52:09.980
You're so close.
He'd love to stick to you.


00:52:10.080 --> 00:52:11.940
Why are you like this?


00:52:12.040 --> 00:52:14.900
Maybe I just dislike seeing
an lsraeli colonel...


00:52:15.000 --> 00:52:17.380
flirting with a Nazi, s son.


00:52:18.240 --> 00:52:20.240
Sorry, I have morals.


00:52:20.280 --> 00:52:22.280
Pathetic!


00:52:26.000 --> 00:52:28.000
Very funny! Bravo!


00:52:57.040 --> 00:52:59.060
Brasilia! We're finally here!


00:52:59.160 --> 00:53:01.620
Thank God we crossed that river!


00:53:01.720 --> 00:53:04.865
Good thing you can build pedal boats!


00:53:05.640 --> 00:53:08.615
I said l'm sorry for the duck head.


00:53:09.000 --> 00:53:11.500
It would have taken a lot longer.


00:53:11.600 --> 00:53:13.600
It would not have!


00:53:14.800 --> 00:53:17.300
The boat's the hard part,
not the duck.


00:53:17.400 --> 00:53:21.225
The duck's a beak and a head.
Forget about it.


00:53:21.880 --> 00:53:24.260
Now we need to find a hotel.


00:53:25.960 --> 00:53:27.960
consider it done.


00:53:31.960 --> 00:53:36.020
I spoke to Father's partner.
He's throwing a party.


00:53:36.120 --> 00:53:37.900
But it's a costume ball.


00:53:38.000 --> 00:53:40.000
That is a problem.


00:53:41.960 --> 00:53:44.580
Unless we wear costumes.
Might be fun.


00:53:44.680 --> 00:53:45.660
Very.


00:53:45.760 --> 00:53:48.735
But we're here to work.
- Of course.


00:53:59.320 --> 00:54:01.320
Time to get to work.


00:54:01.440 --> 00:54:04.670
Let's meet in half an hour.
In costume.


00:54:05.000 --> 00:54:08.230
Don't worry about the drinks.
My treat.


00:54:29.320 --> 00:54:31.320
How did you do that?


00:54:31.880 --> 00:54:33.880
I sew.


00:54:34.080 --> 00:54:35.700
By the way, here.


00:54:35.800 --> 00:54:36.740
For you.


00:54:36.840 --> 00:54:39.940
I want a truce.
Our countries are allies.


00:54:40.040 --> 00:54:42.760
Let's try harder.
- You're right.


00:54:43.840 --> 00:54:45.840
A present.


00:54:46.040 --> 00:54:48.040
From 'Noel'.


00:54:50.320 --> 00:54:52.955
A pun on, , Christmas present'.


00:54:53.200 --> 00:54:54.460
concerning my name.


00:54:54.560 --> 00:54:56.560
I'd understood.


00:54:57.200 --> 00:54:59.200
Otherwise...


00:55:00.240 --> 00:55:02.240
I have the balls.


00:55:03.520 --> 00:55:05.520
Christmas balls?
- Yes!


00:55:14.680 --> 00:55:16.260
Come on, it's funny.


00:55:16.360 --> 00:55:18.360
Enough.


00:55:20.800 --> 00:55:22.800
I have to tell Armang.


00:55:26.640 --> 00:55:28.020
I just thought of it.


00:55:28.120 --> 00:55:31.620
I remembered my name was Noel
and it popped out.


00:55:31.720 --> 00:55:33.180
Christmas balls!


00:55:33.280 --> 00:55:36.000
I think I showed her my package!


00:55:38.680 --> 00:55:41.995
I said to myself:.
..That's for Armand!'


00:55:43.560 --> 00:55:45.420
I have to go. I see a Nazi.


00:55:45.520 --> 00:55:47.645
It's Heinrich. My friend.


00:55:47.720 --> 00:55:49.720
I'll call you back.


00:55:53.360 --> 00:55:54.700
It's not too...?


00:55:54.800 --> 00:55:56.460
No, it's fine. Just fine.


00:55:56.560 --> 00:56:00.215
It's all they had left at the rental place.


00:56:01.080 --> 00:56:03.500
Okay, it's a rental. It figures.


00:56:03.600 --> 00:56:05.600
Now I get it.


00:56:11.640 --> 00:56:13.640
I added this.


00:56:14.680 --> 00:56:16.680
A peace symbol.


00:56:17.120 --> 00:56:20.095
You see? Still our little Heinrich.


00:56:20.680 --> 00:56:22.500
No reason to sulk.


00:56:22.600 --> 00:56:24.725
It's just a Nazi costume.


00:56:31.120 --> 00:56:33.330
It's because she's Jewish.


00:56:46.520 --> 00:56:48.520
Here we are.


00:56:50.480 --> 00:56:51.460
I smell a trap.


00:56:51.560 --> 00:56:54.195
Not so sure. Don't be paranoid.


00:56:54.200 --> 00:56:56.820
Maybe they had the same idea.
- Probably.


00:56:56.920 --> 00:56:59.900
Or they rented
from the same place as Heinrich.


00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:02.720
Possible... but hard to believe.


00:57:14.320 --> 00:57:16.615
I'll find Father's partner.


00:57:27.840 --> 00:57:29.980
Dolores, I owe you an apology.


00:57:30.080 --> 00:57:32.740
You may be right.
This could be a trap.


00:57:32.840 --> 00:57:34.580
No kidding.


00:57:34.680 --> 00:57:37.558
come... Iets try to blend in.


00:57:43.040 --> 00:57:45.040
Got an escape plan?


00:57:45.280 --> 00:57:46.700
I'm working on it.


00:57:46.800 --> 00:57:48.800
Will you have it soon?


00:57:55.000 --> 00:57:57.720
Look! It's Professor Von Zimmel!


00:57:57.960 --> 00:57:59.300
We're still unnoticed.


00:57:59.400 --> 00:58:02.900
Ladies and gentlemen,
sorry to interrupt the music,


00:58:03.000 --> 00:58:05.100
but we have a special guest.


00:58:05.200 --> 00:58:07.380
Iets greet him as he deserves.


00:58:07.480 --> 00:58:11.220
Please give a warm hand
to Mr. Noel Flantier.


00:58:15.360 --> 00:58:17.380
At least l'm still undercover.


00:58:17.480 --> 00:58:20.060
Mr. Noel Flantier, also known as


00:58:20.160 --> 00:58:22.160
OSS 117!


00:58:27.000 --> 00:58:28.060
Heinrich!


00:58:28.160 --> 00:58:30.160
Heinrich is finished.


00:58:34.080 --> 00:58:35.860
I'm Friedrich!


00:58:35.960 --> 00:58:38.110
I'll be gamned! Heinrich?


00:58:38.960 --> 00:58:40.180
A hairpiech?


00:58:40.280 --> 00:58:43.740
You see, there's one thing I didn't lie about.


00:58:43.840 --> 00:58:45.820
My desire to change the world!


00:58:45.920 --> 00:58:48.220
What do you want, Von Zimmel?


00:58:48.320 --> 00:58:49.940
What's this all about?


00:58:50.040 --> 00:58:52.040
The Fourth Reich?


00:58:52.960 --> 00:58:56.060
The Fourth Reich is a dream
doomed to failure.


00:58:56.160 --> 00:58:59.580
Everyone tried it. It never worked.
I'm moving on.


00:58:59.680 --> 00:59:03.060
I've decided to lay the foundation of a real...


00:59:03.160 --> 00:59:05.160
newworld.


00:59:08.640 --> 00:59:11.359
A world more unfair,


00:59:11.720 --> 00:59:13.915
a world more intolerant,


00:59:14.120 --> 00:59:16.120
more unfriendly,


00:59:16.240 --> 00:59:19.198
where there will always be war,


00:59:19.400 --> 00:59:21.400
always disease.


00:59:21.920 --> 00:59:23.920
This world,


00:59:24.520 --> 00:59:26.520
my world,


00:59:27.160 --> 00:59:30.072
is the Fifth Reich!


00:59:36.120 --> 00:59:38.120
Utopists!


00:59:38.800 --> 00:59:40.800
Hold this.


00:59:41.880 --> 00:59:43.880
My friends!


00:59:44.480 --> 00:59:46.380
I understand your anger.


00:59:46.480 --> 00:59:48.605
I understand your hatred.


00:59:48.960 --> 00:59:50.500
But for God's sake,


00:59:50.600 --> 00:59:52.810
don't give into cynicism.


00:59:53.000 --> 00:59:54.900
Beware of hasty solutions.


00:59:55.000 --> 00:59:57.000
Of course.


00:59:57.360 --> 00:59:59.500
I see what you like about Nazism.


00:59:59.600 --> 01:00:01.640
Besides, who's to judge?


01:00:02.280 --> 01:00:04.575
Sometimes even I get angry.


01:00:06.440 --> 01:00:09.100
But are there no other solutions?


01:00:09.200 --> 01:00:13.450
Did the children you once were
dream of this world?


01:00:17.560 --> 01:00:19.855
These children still exist.


01:00:20.880 --> 01:00:22.880
I'm speaking to them.


01:00:22.960 --> 01:00:25.060
Let me ask them a question.


01:00:25.160 --> 01:00:27.160
A simple question.


01:00:34.360 --> 01:00:37.675
What if the 5th Reich were the Reich...


01:00:39.400 --> 01:00:41.400
of Love?


01:01:02.400 --> 01:01:06.220
Instead of inspiring these Nazis
I got taunts and jibes.


01:01:06.320 --> 01:01:08.140
Enough!


01:01:08.240 --> 01:01:12.065
I'll tend to you later.
Put them in my office.


01:01:13.680 --> 01:01:15.680
You're hurting me!


01:01:22.640 --> 01:01:24.640
What the hell?


01:01:26.480 --> 01:01:30.645
Don't worry.
I blundered before, but I'll save us.


01:01:32.920 --> 01:01:34.920
Delightful.


01:01:37.240 --> 01:01:39.549
Hitler! I hate that guy!


01:01:47.360 --> 01:01:49.360
I found my idea.


01:01:49.800 --> 01:01:53.540
I'd say we have half an hour.
Plenty of time.


01:01:55.080 --> 01:01:57.080
Already?


01:01:58.320 --> 01:02:00.740
I was too impatient to see you.


01:02:00.840 --> 01:02:03.475
A waste of time! I won't speak!


01:02:03.680 --> 01:02:06.580
Not a problem.
I haven't asked anything.


01:02:06.680 --> 01:02:10.420
You give me a feeling of deja-vu.
Your tired recipes,


01:02:10.520 --> 01:02:14.780
secret offices, swastikas,
Nazi caverns. It's all so banal.


01:02:14.880 --> 01:02:16.880
Of course.


01:02:18.400 --> 01:02:20.675
You, on the other hand,


01:02:22.720 --> 01:02:24.720
are a reporter.


01:02:27.600 --> 01:02:30.065
Are you writing a nice story?


01:02:32.080 --> 01:02:33.420
You're teasing me.


01:02:33.520 --> 01:02:35.520
Taking nice pictures?


01:02:38.360 --> 01:02:40.360
Mr. Noel Flantier!


01:02:41.160 --> 01:02:42.900
Nazi humor. Pathetic.


01:02:43.000 --> 01:02:45.195
The joke's over, OSS 117!


01:02:50.360 --> 01:02:52.360
Turn aroung!


01:03:05.160 --> 01:03:07.628
Welcome to my laboratory!


01:03:08.840 --> 01:03:10.140
Zantrax, Blue Devil,


01:03:10.240 --> 01:03:12.380
undress him and tie him up!


01:03:12.480 --> 01:03:13.500
Why me?


01:03:13.600 --> 01:03:17.510
My costume!
Fascist dogs, you, ll pay for this!


01:03:19.440 --> 01:03:20.900
Carlotta!


01:03:21.000 --> 01:03:24.700
So that's something more comfy?
Those rags of hate and chaos!


01:03:24.800 --> 01:03:27.540
I am not Carlotta.
I'm Fraulein Freida.


01:03:27.640 --> 01:03:30.445
For me you'll always be Carlotta.


01:03:30.760 --> 01:03:33.990
For me you'll always be Noel Flantier.


01:03:40.200 --> 01:03:42.200
No more games!


01:03:42.400 --> 01:03:44.940
Enough boasting, Mr. de la Bath.


01:03:45.040 --> 01:03:48.220
Now we'll see what you're really made of.


01:03:48.320 --> 01:03:50.020
You won't be the first.


01:03:50.120 --> 01:03:54.455
No, l'm talking literally
about what you're made of.


01:03:56.600 --> 01:03:58.220
What are you doing?


01:03:58.320 --> 01:04:00.436
I'm opening my safe.


01:04:00.640 --> 01:04:04.020
Years ago, I sewed into your chest
two microfilms.


01:04:04.120 --> 01:04:06.980
One, a list of French collaborators.


01:04:07.080 --> 01:04:09.435
The other, more important:


01:04:09.640 --> 01:04:14.180
a list of Swiss bank accounts
containing fabulous war treasures.


01:04:14.280 --> 01:04:15.900
Why don't I remember?


01:04:16.000 --> 01:04:17.460
Thanks to this.


01:04:17.560 --> 01:04:20.875
A potion that erases short-term memory.


01:04:21.800 --> 01:04:22.860
My God!


01:04:22.960 --> 01:04:24.960
I remember!


01:04:26.800 --> 01:04:27.980
What are you doing?


01:04:28.080 --> 01:04:30.310
I'm opening my safe.


01:04:30.520 --> 01:04:33.980
I'm sewing into your chest two microfilms.


01:04:34.080 --> 01:04:36.620
One, a list of French collaborators.


01:04:36.720 --> 01:04:37.980
The other,


01:04:38.080 --> 01:04:42.140
a list of Swiss bank accounts
containing fabulous war treasures!


01:04:42.240 --> 01:04:43.740
Why won't I remember?


01:04:43.840 --> 01:04:45.700
Thanks to this!


01:04:45.800 --> 01:04:49.455
A potion that erases all short-term memory.


01:04:53.240 --> 01:04:54.500
Intact.


01:04:54.600 --> 01:04:56.795
Thank you, OSS 117.


01:04:57.360 --> 01:05:01.060
Now you see why it had to be you
who came here.


01:05:01.160 --> 01:05:05.750
All that best agent stuff
was hogwash. But you knew it.


01:05:06.480 --> 01:05:08.710
Goodbye, OSS 117.


01:05:10.280 --> 01:05:12.280
Kill them.


01:05:16.840 --> 01:05:18.840
Untie him!


01:05:20.840 --> 01:05:23.560
I paid you'd say.
Said you'd pay.


01:05:23.720 --> 01:05:25.460
Whatever.


01:05:25.560 --> 01:05:28.790
Good going, Dolores.
Get the microfilm.


01:05:32.200 --> 01:05:33.260
It's not me.


01:05:33.360 --> 01:05:35.140
Who then?


01:05:35.240 --> 01:05:37.993
I saw. I know.
But I won't say.


01:05:38.800 --> 01:05:40.340
Friedrich...


01:05:40.440 --> 01:05:42.440
My schon.


01:05:46.440 --> 01:05:48.440
Why?


01:05:49.880 --> 01:05:51.880
Kill them!


01:06:31.160 --> 01:06:33.160
Let's go.


01:06:47.400 --> 01:06:49.400
Careful, Hubert!


01:07:32.840 --> 01:07:35.050
Go on, be more aggressive!


01:07:59.240 --> 01:08:01.240
Go on!


01:08:25.880 --> 01:08:26.740
Look.


01:08:26.840 --> 01:08:28.840
No hair.


01:08:29.480 --> 01:08:31.480
Hair we go again!


01:08:31.680 --> 01:08:33.020
Your bow and arrows.


01:08:33.120 --> 01:08:35.840
You're right.
Lets go, Dolores!


01:08:41.880 --> 01:08:44.175
This round, s not over yet.


01:08:53.560 --> 01:08:55.560
Shoot, Hubert.


01:09:04.440 --> 01:09:06.440
I don't understang...


01:09:07.320 --> 01:09:09.540
Of course! It's a kiddie toy!


01:09:09.640 --> 01:09:11.780
Hurry, they, re getting away!


01:09:11.880 --> 01:09:13.920
Right! Let, s tail them!


01:09:34.840 --> 01:09:36.840
There they are!


01:09:51.080 --> 01:09:52.540
You drive like a man!


01:09:52.640 --> 01:09:55.220
We need Von Zimmel.
We can't fail.


01:09:55.320 --> 01:09:57.320
That was a compliment.


01:09:57.480 --> 01:09:59.775
Israel must judge ex-Nazis.


01:10:00.040 --> 01:10:00.860
Of course.


01:10:00.960 --> 01:10:04.860
It's our responsibility.
We're a modern democracy.


01:10:04.960 --> 01:10:06.960
You bet!


01:10:10.760 --> 01:10:12.580
You surprise me.


01:10:12.680 --> 01:10:15.380
You're dogged, brave.
You never crack.


01:10:15.480 --> 01:10:17.480
Never chicken out.


01:10:17.640 --> 01:10:20.700
You're fearless, beautiful, elegant.


01:10:22.320 --> 01:10:25.805
It's simple: you're my female alter-ego.


01:10:27.560 --> 01:10:29.420
I like you.


01:10:29.520 --> 01:10:31.520
A lot.


01:10:31.920 --> 01:10:33.920
Know what I want?


01:10:39.040 --> 01:10:40.260
I don't get it.


01:10:40.360 --> 01:10:41.620
You turn me off.


01:10:41.720 --> 01:10:43.720
And I don't get it!


01:10:44.080 --> 01:10:45.140
Explain yourself.


01:10:45.240 --> 01:10:48.340
I'm a remedy against barbarism,
a symbol of...


01:10:48.440 --> 01:10:50.260
You're old. Pretentious.


01:10:50.360 --> 01:10:51.940
A misogynist.


01:10:52.040 --> 01:10:54.820
Full of yourself, vain,
borderline racist.


01:10:54.920 --> 01:10:59.000
Tacky dresser, childish, not funny.
Shall I stop?


01:11:00.960 --> 01:11:02.960
A tacky dresser?


01:11:10.200 --> 01:11:12.200
It's hot in here.


01:11:24.680 --> 01:11:26.805
I like it when you smile.


01:11:27.640 --> 01:11:30.020
You have a very sweet smile.


01:11:32.440 --> 01:11:34.990
You must have heard it before.


01:11:51.680 --> 01:11:53.680
Look, they pulleg over.


01:11:53.840 --> 01:11:55.740
No more gas. How typical.


01:11:55.840 --> 01:11:58.050
The problem with Mercedes.


01:12:04.120 --> 01:12:04.780
Follow her.


01:12:04.880 --> 01:12:05.620
I'll get him.


01:12:05.720 --> 01:12:07.660
Remember. We neeg him alive.


01:12:07.760 --> 01:12:09.760
Count on me.


01:14:12.160 --> 01:14:14.160
Where am l?


01:14:23.280 --> 01:14:25.280
Von Zim...


01:15:01.960 --> 01:15:03.960
Stop.


01:15:27.680 --> 01:15:29.680
Von Zim...


01:16:55.400 --> 01:16:57.400
Going up?


01:17:03.800 --> 01:17:05.800
Are you okay?


01:17:06.080 --> 01:17:08.080
Fine, thanks.


01:17:11.480 --> 01:17:13.100
Where are my clothes?


01:17:13.200 --> 01:17:16.500
The green leotard?
It was torn. We tossed it.


01:17:16.600 --> 01:17:18.600
Pity.


01:17:18.960 --> 01:17:20.960
Got any spare clothes?


01:17:22.120 --> 01:17:24.330
The old gardener has some.


01:17:24.640 --> 01:17:27.275
But they may not be your style.


01:17:27.480 --> 01:17:31.305
Pertect. Not the latest fashion,
but it'll do.


01:17:41.400 --> 01:17:43.620
Did the old geezer make a call?


01:17:43.720 --> 01:17:45.720
With a bit of luck...


01:17:52.440 --> 01:17:54.460
Doodles. They make no sense.


01:17:54.560 --> 01:17:55.700
Why not ask him?


01:17:55.800 --> 01:17:58.945
He said '8 o'clock at the Corcovado.'


01:18:00.320 --> 01:18:02.320
May l?
- Of course.


01:18:10.720 --> 01:18:12.720
It's urgent.


01:18:17.280 --> 01:18:19.280
It's ringing.


01:18:20.880 --> 01:18:21.620
It's me, Hubert.


01:18:21.720 --> 01:18:24.180
I was worried sick.
- You were anxious?


01:18:24.280 --> 01:18:26.280
I thought you died.


01:18:26.600 --> 01:18:28.420
How king. Get Carlotta?


01:18:28.520 --> 01:18:29.740
She's behind bars.


01:18:29.840 --> 01:18:33.940
Von Zimmel is meeting someone
at the Corcovado at 8 o, clock.


01:18:34.040 --> 01:18:36.300
Let's meet at Bill's office.


01:18:36.400 --> 01:18:38.400
See you. Be careful.


01:18:45.880 --> 01:18:47.880
Bill, it's Hubert.


01:18:50.080 --> 01:18:52.060
Yes, probably. It's about Dolores.


01:18:52.160 --> 01:18:53.700
I need your help.


01:18:53.800 --> 01:18:56.520
Von Zimmel, the Corcovado, at 8.


01:18:57.200 --> 01:18:59.200
Obviously.


01:19:26.520 --> 01:19:28.520
Good! It's all clear.


01:19:29.360 --> 01:19:32.060
You, ve helped France.
I'm forever grateful.


01:19:32.160 --> 01:19:34.460
By the way,
where can I find a car?


01:19:34.560 --> 01:19:36.420
The old gardener has one.


01:19:36.520 --> 01:19:38.520
But is it your style?


01:20:49.440 --> 01:20:51.440
Bill?


01:21:15.880 --> 01:21:17.880
Dolores?


01:21:35.320 --> 01:21:37.320
You gave me a scare!


01:21:38.440 --> 01:21:40.440
What's wrong with you?


01:21:42.560 --> 01:21:44.140
Except for the heat.


01:21:44.240 --> 01:21:46.240
What is it?


01:21:46.320 --> 01:21:49.295
Von Zimmel is scared of the Mossad.


01:21:49.480 --> 01:21:53.620
He contacted the ClA
in exchange for valuable information.


01:21:53.720 --> 01:21:55.720
Clever, Bill.


01:21:55.800 --> 01:21:57.260
Why protect an SS?


01:21:57.360 --> 01:21:59.380
Americans are against Nazis!


01:21:59.480 --> 01:22:01.980
The ClA isn't America, OSS 117.


01:22:02.080 --> 01:22:03.140
That hurts!


01:22:03.240 --> 01:22:05.280
Freeze or l'll slay her.


01:22:06.840 --> 01:22:09.220
Free her.
Our countries are allies.


01:22:09.320 --> 01:22:12.940
We're allies
only when you ask us to liberate you.


01:22:13.040 --> 01:22:14.220
Meaning?


01:22:14.320 --> 01:22:15.780
I'm sorry.


01:22:15.880 --> 01:22:18.005
You liberated yourselves.


01:22:19.840 --> 01:22:21.060
Chinaman behind you!


01:22:21.160 --> 01:22:23.160
How old are you?


01:22:25.960 --> 01:22:28.085
You kill brother in taxi.


01:22:33.520 --> 01:22:35.815
Put down your gun, OSS 117!


01:22:41.840 --> 01:22:44.580
Carlotta, you can still make amends.


01:22:44.680 --> 01:22:48.930
The Nazi hunters and the Chinese
will never let up.


01:22:49.680 --> 01:22:52.060
I beg of you, think it over.


01:22:58.680 --> 01:22:59.740
If you help us.


01:22:59.840 --> 01:23:04.900
I'll serve as a mediator with the
Prime Minister, Mr. Pompidou.


01:23:05.000 --> 01:23:06.460
You'll be pardoned.


01:23:06.560 --> 01:23:10.900
An international coalition
will be immediately organized...


01:23:11.000 --> 01:23:13.125
to create a Nazi country.


01:23:15.240 --> 01:23:17.240
Like lsrael.


01:23:28.600 --> 01:23:30.020
Great to see you.


01:23:30.120 --> 01:23:31.580
I prayed you'd come.


01:23:31.680 --> 01:23:34.700
Really?
You've said two nice things now.


01:23:34.800 --> 01:23:37.420
Are you sure?
- The first was on the phone...


01:23:37.520 --> 01:23:39.660
We're in a rush, Hubert.
- You're right.


01:23:39.760 --> 01:23:41.760
Come on!


01:23:45.400 --> 01:23:47.400
Give me a second.


01:23:50.400 --> 01:23:52.400
Don't I know you?


01:23:52.760 --> 01:23:54.460
Yeah!


01:23:54.560 --> 01:23:57.195
We slept together on the beach.


01:23:58.000 --> 01:24:00.000
Slept together?


01:24:01.200 --> 01:24:03.325
You make it sound like...


01:24:18.920 --> 01:24:22.037
And what are you up to now?


01:24:22.360 --> 01:24:24.655
I'm eating a candied apple.


01:24:25.440 --> 01:24:27.440
Want a bite?


01:24:28.280 --> 01:24:31.170
To hell with your forbidden fruit!


01:24:42.200 --> 01:24:44.200
Don, t worry!


01:24:49.560 --> 01:24:51.855
Remember, I need him alive.


01:24:52.160 --> 01:24:54.660
Surrender, Von Zimmel! It's over!


01:24:54.760 --> 01:24:58.260
Trumendous is dead. Carlotta too.
And the Chinaman!


01:24:58.360 --> 01:25:00.360
They never met.


01:25:01.760 --> 01:25:04.860
Be a man, Von Zimmel.
Surrender Quietly.


01:25:04.960 --> 01:25:06.960
I'g rather gie first.


01:25:07.080 --> 01:25:10.460
Too bad for you, Dolores.
I intend to die.


01:25:10.560 --> 01:25:13.140
You killed my son, now my fiancee.


01:25:13.240 --> 01:25:16.300
You stole it all.
My death belongs to me!


01:25:16.400 --> 01:25:17.620
He's going to shoot.


01:25:17.720 --> 01:25:19.140
He's bluffing.


01:25:19.240 --> 01:25:22.300
I doubt it.
He knows what awaits him.


01:25:22.560 --> 01:25:23.860
By the way,


01:25:23.960 --> 01:25:26.425
in case you haven, t noticed,


01:25:27.840 --> 01:25:29.840
behind the Nazi...


01:25:30.840 --> 01:25:32.840
there's also a man.


01:25:32.840 --> 01:25:34.910
A man like any other.


01:25:35.480 --> 01:25:37.480
A Nazi...


01:25:38.280 --> 01:25:40.280
does he not have eyes?


01:25:42.360 --> 01:25:44.360
A Nazi...


01:25:44.520 --> 01:25:46.140
does he not have hands?


01:25:46.240 --> 01:25:48.900
You're right. I think he, s sincere.


01:25:49.000 --> 01:25:51.000
He's desperate.


01:25:52.160 --> 01:25:53.940
If you prick us,


01:25:54.040 --> 01:25:56.040
do we not bleed?


01:25:56.720 --> 01:25:58.790
If you tickle us,


01:25:59.400 --> 01:26:01.400
do we not laugh?


01:26:02.040 --> 01:26:04.429
And if you poison us,


01:26:04.760 --> 01:26:07.354
do we not die?


01:26:11.160 --> 01:26:12.700
Magnificent.


01:26:12.800 --> 01:26:14.800
Beautiful worgs.


01:26:14.880 --> 01:26:17.175
Beautiful and overwhelming.


01:26:17.840 --> 01:26:19.840
I'm an old man...


01:26:20.320 --> 01:26:24.060
I'm 46. My life is over.
You've taken it all.


01:26:24.320 --> 01:26:27.040
I'll go around.
- Leave it to me.


01:26:28.480 --> 01:26:30.480
Farewell, OSS 117.


01:26:31.920 --> 01:26:33.020
That's enough!


01:26:33.120 --> 01:26:36.060
For France, turn over the microfilm!


01:26:36.160 --> 01:26:38.965
And for lsrael, turn yourself in!


01:26:40.880 --> 01:26:42.880
What now?


01:26:44.400 --> 01:26:47.800
He's going to plunge from Christ, s arm!


01:26:47.960 --> 01:26:50.940
Not if we stop him from taking the plunge!


01:26:51.040 --> 01:26:53.165
And your fear of heights?


01:26:53.840 --> 01:26:55.900
Each of us must conquer his fears.


01:26:56.000 --> 01:26:58.000
Yours is Nazis.


01:26:58.680 --> 01:27:00.680
Mine is trapeze.


01:27:51.160 --> 01:27:53.140
Halt, Von Zimmel! Surrenger!


01:27:53.240 --> 01:27:54.580
Surrender?


01:27:54.680 --> 01:27:57.260
Find something more persuasive, old pal.


01:27:57.360 --> 01:28:01.100
And try not to get one of your dizzy spells.


01:28:03.040 --> 01:28:07.375
You, ll have to move forward
despite your vertigo...


01:28:42.360 --> 01:28:44.060
It was an accigent!


01:28:44.160 --> 01:28:46.754
A simple trapeze accident!


01:28:51.920 --> 01:28:54.593
Farewell... OSS 117.


01:29:11.480 --> 01:29:13.480
Let go of me!


01:29:13.680 --> 01:29:14.660
Let go!


01:29:14.760 --> 01:29:16.340
Not this time!


01:29:16.440 --> 01:29:19.500
Wilkommen in lsrael, Herr Protessor!


01:29:21.040 --> 01:29:22.580
Bravo, Hubert.


01:29:22.680 --> 01:29:25.570
To the spy and the trapeze artist.


01:29:26.000 --> 01:29:27.860
Thanks for saving his life.


01:29:27.960 --> 01:29:29.220
It's nothing.


01:29:29.320 --> 01:29:32.805
I'm proud to help an lsraeli save a Nazi.


01:29:32.920 --> 01:29:34.220
I see it as a sign.


01:29:34.320 --> 01:29:38.540
Why not hope for reconciliation
between Jews and Nazis?


01:29:38.640 --> 01:29:40.860
Something about you baffles me.


01:29:40.960 --> 01:29:42.580
What?


01:29:42.680 --> 01:29:44.680
This.


01:29:48.520 --> 01:29:50.520
Happy, Noel.


01:30:39.880 --> 01:30:40.860
Hello, boss.


01:30:40.960 --> 01:30:42.460
Hello, Hubert. Bravo!


01:30:42.560 --> 01:30:45.740
We got the microfilm without even paying.


01:30:45.840 --> 01:30:46.740
Hats off!


01:30:46.840 --> 01:30:48.840
Thank God you sent me.


01:30:51.840 --> 01:30:56.090
Want to show me a movie?
- lt's broken. Tough luck.


01:30:57.520 --> 01:31:00.750
I want to discuss...
something irksome.


01:31:01.560 --> 01:31:03.420
It's probably nothing but...


01:31:03.520 --> 01:31:07.175
your name was on the list of collaborators.


01:31:07.640 --> 01:31:09.640
I heard that.


01:31:12.280 --> 01:31:13.900
Trying times...


01:31:14.000 --> 01:31:16.000
Trying times...


01:31:18.440 --> 01:31:20.480
But what's past is past.


01:31:21.680 --> 01:31:24.995
France needs to forget.
To move forward.


01:31:26.360 --> 01:31:28.360
Yes, no doubt.


01:31:28.360 --> 01:31:30.100
Now I feel reassured.


01:31:30.200 --> 01:31:32.240
I've thought of you too.


01:31:34.040 --> 01:31:34.980
You mean?


01:31:35.080 --> 01:31:37.080
The Legion of Honor.


01:31:39.320 --> 01:31:42.340
I spoke to the Prime Minister,
Mr. Pompidou.


01:31:42.440 --> 01:31:44.480
It can happen this week.


01:31:51.680 --> 01:31:54.340
Thank you, Armand.
I'm speechless.


01:31:54.440 --> 01:31:56.180
So don't speak.


01:31:56.280 --> 01:31:57.700
You're not vain.


01:31:57.800 --> 01:31:59.100
Of course I'm not.


01:31:59.200 --> 01:32:01.200
Of course!


01:32:01.400 --> 01:32:03.140
Let's get down to business.


01:32:03.240 --> 01:32:06.140
You have another mission.
To China, no less.


01:32:06.240 --> 01:32:07.580
A man named Lee...


01:32:07.680 --> 01:32:11.420
took 50 French hostages
and will negotiate only with you.


01:32:11.520 --> 01:32:12.660
One condition.


01:32:12.760 --> 01:32:14.220
Deal. What is it?


01:32:14.320 --> 01:32:16.320
I pick my own name.


01:32:18.960 --> 01:32:22.445
For Mr. Lee,
I can grant you some lee-way.


01:32:30.120 --> 01:32:32.120
Lee-ve it to me!


01:32:36.200 --> 01:32:38.410
Although it's not lee-gal.


01:32:46.520 --> 01:32:48.520
Be lee-nient!


01:32:49.640 --> 01:32:52.275
I think we've about covereg it.


01:32:55.480 --> 01:32:57.480
You're right.


01:33:00.760 --> 01:33:02.760
Follow the lee-der.


01:33:07.320 --> 01:33:09.320
It, s very strange.


01:33:09.320 --> 01:33:12.300
Unintentionally,
I just used Jewish humor.


01:33:12.400 --> 01:33:14.400
Really? What, s that?


01:33:15.200 --> 01:33:20.215
It's when it's not funny
and there's no mention of sausages.

